WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.420
The Hundred-Dish Royal Cooking Competition

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:37.580
is at the tasting stage.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.260
The future of the whole country depends on it.

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:41.550
But the Emperor

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:44.840
decided to taste Fei's cuisine of New China first.

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:46.070
He was so full

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:47.370
that he didn't even

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:48.310
look at our dishes.

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:50.940
But I risked my life

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:52.400
to ask the Emperor to taste my porridge.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.220
Bring the dim sum to me.

00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:00.120
I want to try it.

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:06.220
Huge Reversal
Heroic Chefs of Glory

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:27.410
The dim sum is made by the best baker

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.100
on the Chinese mainland, Steel Bar Xie.

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:31.030
Please enjoy.

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:32.440
Great, Lei En.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:37.220
But the Emperor is full, isn't he?

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:39.000
Yes! Sister!

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:42.030
The Emperor must like Mao's dishes.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.180
But Silang, look.

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:45.460
The Emperor didn't eat every dish.

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:57.290
Damn it!

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.920
I'm confident about my cooking.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.750
You'll see if you taste my dishes.

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:11.190
Yes! He will definitely

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:12.630
like my Creative Dumplings.

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:14.470
We still have hope.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:16.450
Next is my best work,

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.360
shumai.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:22.610
He skipped it too.

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.630
How can he do that?

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:44.600
The Emperor only tastes one for every five dishes.

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:45.960
They can't compare with us.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:47.780
My Man-Han Banquet

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:48.680
based on the idea of New China

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:50.750
is definitely perfect.

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:52.240
But why am I

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:53.810
feeling anxious?

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:57.620
Come on. Try all of them.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:58.280
Yeah, please!

00:03:58.330 --> 00:03:59.960
They worked so hard for those dishes.

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.030
Zhou Yu.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:02.610
Yes.

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:06.230
The porridge Mao gave the Emperor...

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.270
As far as I can see,

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.260
there must be some secrets about the porridge.

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:11.620
Yes.

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:13.820
It seems that the frequency of the Emperor

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:14.770
raising the chopsticks is increasing.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.310
Yes, it is!

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:24.320
He tried one for every five dishes just now.

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:25.090
Now it's three,

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:27.770
no, one for every two dishes.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.150
What?

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:31.220
Look carefully.

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.540
He is not getting new chopsticks.

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:33.690
He can't stop eating.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:36.990
Chef Xie. Lei En.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.360
Great. That's more like it.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:45.650
Yes.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:53.720
That's all for the tasting stage.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:55.750
Why?

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.700
What's wrong with you, Majordomo Long?

00:04:57.850 --> 00:04:59.350
The Emperor is still eating!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:02.320
It will be a waste of time.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.090
How could it be a waste of time?

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.920
Yeah. We need an explanation.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.520
The Emperor has tried

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.960
all of Fei's dishes.

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:10.680
But

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:12.590
what about yours?

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:14.900
He didn't touch

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:16.620
many of your dishes.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.880
The quantity is not important.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:20.120
What's important is the quality.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.150
Yeah! Yeah!

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.710
Look. The Emperor is still eating!

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:25.290
Anyway,

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.880
the winner of

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:28.810
the Royal Cooking Competition

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.350
is Lan Feihong's group.

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:40.990
You can't decide

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:41.790
who is the winner.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.960
You can't. You are not the Emperor.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:48.270
You agree with me, don't you?

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:49.410
Your Majesty.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:55.020
This dish is so beautiful!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.010
What is this?

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:01.740
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.890
It is called the Crystal Phoenix.

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:08.810
The Crystal Phoenix!

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.990
(Crystal Phoenix)

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:14.360
The Crystal Phoenix!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.500
It's so beautiful!

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:16.460
Look at the phoenix.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.580
It's shining

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:18.980
just like crystal!

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.250
Have you seen it before?

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:22.640
Idiots.

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:23.960
Look!

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:26.510
It is just decorated with

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:27.280
stir-fried bean sprouts.

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.580
It's just eye candy.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:32.160
What? Bean sprouts?

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:34.510
What is wrong with Mao?

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:35.610
How could he cook bean sprouts

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.830
at a time like this?

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:39.020
Yes.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.440
There are many

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:42.070
fancy ingredients!

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.700
I can't believe they are just bean sprouts.

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:47.070
It should be called the Ruyi Dish.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:48.400
The Ruyi Dish?

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:49.120
Yes.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.300
It looks like

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:51.930
the Ruyi Golden Cudgel of the Monkey King.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:52.130
(Ruyi Dish)

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:52.760
(Ruyi Dish)
That's why I named it the Ruyi Dish.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:53.270
(Ruyi Dish)

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:53.760
(Ruyi Dish)
They are bean sprouts

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:54.060
(Ruyi Dish)

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:56.470
(Ruyi Dish)
without the roots and sprouts.

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:56.500
(Ruyi Dish)

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:58.080
Oh, he was trimming

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:01.520
bean sprouts for this dish.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:04.210
The bean sprouts are ordinary.

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:05.910
But if you carefully

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:08.010
get rid of the roots and sprouts,

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:09.800
they will become fancy.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:10.780
And the flavor

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:11.980
will be fresh.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.310
It's a totally different feeling.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:15.090
Yes.

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:17.000
And they will become

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:18.350
sparkling like crystal.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:19.550
After decorating,

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:20.760
nothing is more suitable than it

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:22.780
to be called the Crystal Phoenix.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:25.560
The Ruyi Dish.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:26.710
It's interesting.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.790
The flavor is fresh

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:41.920
but not strong.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:46.790
What are you waiting for?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.330
The tasting stage is over.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:49.880
Get rid of them.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:50.790
Yes.

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:58.250
What are you doing?

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.880
I'm so sorry.

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:14.880
Good.

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:39.640
The Emperor finished

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:42.080
the whole plate of the Crystal Phoenix!

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:05.910
Next!

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:08.930
Bring the next dish!

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:10.240
Yes!

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:21.140
Oh my gosh!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.610
Yes!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:23.600
Help yourself!

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:24.370
Your Majesty!

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.250
Eat!

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:27.450
Eat all you want!

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:28.340
What?

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:29.350
What's going on?

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:32.540
Your Majesty,

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.810
it's bad for your health.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:36.540
Get out of the way!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:39.300
I will eat whatever I want.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:40.430
You can't!

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.330
You can't eat anymore!

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.030
Wow!

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:01.390
Yes!

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:02.910
Yes! Your Majesty!

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:04.000
How is this possible?

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.500
I can't eat anymore.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:23.220
He ate up all of the one hundred dishes!

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:24.820
I can't believe it.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.010
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:47.420
Look!

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:50.030
The happiness on the Emperor's face.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.170
It seems that the Emperor is satisfied.

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:56.940
See? Old man.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:58.010
Do you still think

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.810
Mao's group is the loser?

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:00.910
Shut up!

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:03.920
The Emperor's decision

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.140
can't be changed.

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:09.210
It's strange.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:11.260
I don't remember

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.040
the Emperor has made any decision.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:15.230
What about you guys?

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:18.240
Is there anything wrong with my ears?

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:19.910
We didn't hear, either.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.110
Yeah.

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:23.160
According to tradition,

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.740
the outcome of the Royal Cooking Competition

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:28.460
must be announced by the Emperor.

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:32.120
But that outcome was not announced by the Emperor.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.030
It was announced by you!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.490
So that outcome doesn't count.

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:40.200
It doesn't count!

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:42.420
Silence!

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:45.490
How dare you shout in front of the Emperor?

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.820
Take these losers away!

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:49.520
Yes!

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:55.260
Mao!

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:56.360
Mao!

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:58.090
Arrest them!

00:11:58.140 --> 00:11:58.600
Wait!

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:05.610
Mao, let me ask you.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:07.140
Yes.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.210
What magic did you put

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:11.080
into the dishes?

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:12.990
There is no magic.

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:16.100
I just observed you

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.670
and found something about you.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.340
Found something?

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:19.990
Yes.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:21.370
In Sichuan,

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:22.640
at the state-owned restaurant Chrysanthemum Tower

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.110
where my mother worked as the head chef,

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.520
I saw someone

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:28.610
who has the same problem as you.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:34.430
He was rich.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:36.470
He ate all kinds of costly food.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:37.830
But he didn't look well.

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:39.890
And he yawned all the time.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:44.390
After he had

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:47.030
the porridge my mother prepared for him,

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:48.810
he immediately looked well

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:50.330
and became energetic.

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:54.910
That's because

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.510
the fancier the dish,

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:57.760
the more oil it contains,

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:59.040
and the thicker its flavor is.

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:00.480
It's a burden for the body.

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:01.360
Which is to say,

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.980
if people only eat fancy Chinese dishes,

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.830
their organs will become weak.

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:08.540
In other words,

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:10.580
Mao's mother's porridge

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:11.760
is made of herbs.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.180
It can also

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:15.720
serve as medicine.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.720
Yeah, the story suddenly occurred to me.

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:20.380
So I made the porridge.

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:21.480
It tastes good,

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:22.490
and is good for your health.

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:25.140
I put nutritious pumpkin

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:26.230
and detoxicating perilla

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:28.560
into the steamed stuffed buns,

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:30.470
dumplings and shumai.

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.150
I also added nourishing substances

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:34.140
such as walnuts and pine nuts

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:35.590
into the sashimi sauce.

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.060
In my Crystal Phoenix,

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:38.990
I also put

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.410
detoxicating substances

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.780
such as ginger and garlic.

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:45.750
So,

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:46.910
your dishes are not only delicious

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:48.490
but are designed

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.830
according to my physical condition.

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:54.210
I want to eat them again.

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:56.540
It has been so long

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:58.450
since I looked forward to getting hungry.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.460
The winner is Liu Maoxing!

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:19.620
Mao!

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:24.080
Hooray! Hooray!

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.060
Come here, Mao.

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:29.360
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.490
I will reward you.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:32.950
What do you want?

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:34.810
Just tell me.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:35.840
Your Majesty,

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:36.860
can you please release

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.610
Provincial Military Commander Li from prison?

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:41.270
What? Is that your only wish?

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:41.950
Yes.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:44.030
And please allow him to tell you

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.340
about the Dark Cooking Society.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:47.350
The result of the competition is settled.

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:48.540
These three people

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:50.420
will be disqualified as chefs

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:53.010
and will be banished from Peking.

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.670
Majordomo Long, you...

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:56.760
You betrayed us!

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:58.590
What are you talking about?

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:00.620
Quickly! Take them away!

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:01.820
Okay.

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:04.130
I will tell people everything!

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:05.660
Go!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.260
Fei!

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.560
Fei, hang in there.

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:22.910
Fei, what's wrong with you?

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:24.200
He is not having a fever.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:26.130
It doesn't make sense. He is in pain.

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:27.820
There must be something wrong.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.050
But we don't know what caused the pain.

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.660
We can't help him.

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:34.550
What should I do?

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:36.760
How can I save Fei?

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:37.990
What should I do?

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:55.960
The legendary cook wares.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.750
What is happening?

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:11.910
Maybe it will work.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:16.130
Combine the power of

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:19.260
the Forever-Spirit Knife, the Dragon Pot

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:20.020
and the Demon Saint Bronze.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.470
The soup is done.

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:43.750
Here, Fei.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:54.630
Fei.

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:55.280
Mao.

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.150
You woke up!

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:58.990
What happened?

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.720
Why did you join the Dark Cooking Society?

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:05.660
After I took the Super Chef Test,

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:06.720
my lost memory

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:08.440
came back.

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:11.870
It was the Dark Cooking Society

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:13.450
who kidnapped me and murdered my parents.

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:18.780
Later, to seek revenge,

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:20.630
I went to the headquarter of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:35.080
No!

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:38.940
The pill must be the poison

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.200
that the Dark Cooking Society uses to control people.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:41.120
Poison?

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:43.670
To get into the Forbidden City,

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:46.360
apart from Majordomo Long's help,

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:48.490
the Dark Cooking Society needs a Super Chef like me

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.590
to cover for them.

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:55.400
Majordomo Long works for the Dark Cooking Society.

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:58.420
I always knew there was something wrong with him.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:01.410
Hey, how much money they paid you?

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:05.260
There is nowhere to escape.

00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:07.450
Come to your senses, Majordomo Long.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:13.130
Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:15.060
I'm sorry to make you worry.

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:16.170
I see.

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.600
Majordomo Long has been lying to me
from the very beginning.

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:20.230
Your Majesty,

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.590
how will you reward or punish them?

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:25.250
It's your call.

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:27.770
I'm happy as long as

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:28.980
I can eat Mao's dishes.

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:29.600
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:31.910
Liu Maoxing.

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:32.710
Yes.

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:34.500
From now on, you are

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:37.550
the royal chef of the royal kitchen.

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:40.380
He finally climbed to the top.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:41.100
Yes.

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:42.220
He is now

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:43.760
the best chef in China.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.250
Yeah!

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:46.920
Hooray!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:49.320
Your Majesty,

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:51.450
thank you for your kindness.

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:52.650
But I can't accept it.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.570
Because there is an important mission

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:55.600
waiting for me.

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:56.560
What?

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:57.890
He turned it down.

00:18:58.160 --> 00:18:59.670
What a pity!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.760
What is the important mission?

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:04.540
The mission is to

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:05.340
find out all the legendary cook wares.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:06.840
Majordomo Long.

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:07.690
What is he talking about?

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:08.570
Yes.

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:10.520
You saw what happened just now.

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:12.050
The legendary cook wares

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.870
have immense power.

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.210
If the Dark Cooking Society

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.850
has the other legendary cook wares,

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:21.450
it will be able to control the whole country.

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:23.510
That would be a disaster.

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:25.660
Is there any way we can stop them?

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:27.040
There is only one way.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:27.830
What is it?

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:32.000
That is to let Mao find them and take them back.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.300
But, if Mao leaves...

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:36.850
If the Dark Cooking Society

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:38.720
has the legendary cook wares,

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:40.080
it will be able to

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.850
control the whole country.

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:44.830
I see.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:45.850
It would be a shame.

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:47.170
But I can live with it.

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:48.640
Your Majesty,

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:50.160
it's kind of you to sacrifice

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:51.570
for the well-being of your people.

00:19:54.890 --> 00:19:57.370
Mao. Lei En. Chef Xie.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.570
Listen.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:00.340
By the order of the Emperor,

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.330
you will start the journey

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:04.370
of finding the legendary cook wares.

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:06.420
Hooray!

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:07.500
Yes.

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:09.380
And Lan Feihong.

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:09.970
Yes.

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:12.300
Although the Dark Cooking Society controlled you,

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:13.320
you made a mistake.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:14.900
I will punish you.

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:16.980
You will go with Mao.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.070
Even if you sacrifice your life,

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:19.980
you must find the cook wares.

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:21.710
Do you understand?

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:22.750
Yes.

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:23.800
Fei.

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:25.660
It will be

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:27.070
a difficult

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:28.140
and dangerous journey.

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.560
The punishment is severe.

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:32.810
But you deserve it.

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:35.120
You should make up for your mistake.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:35.770
Yes.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.050
It's great, Fei!

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:40.430
I'm so sorry.

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:42.390
Mao!

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:45.200
Mao, you made it!

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:45.930
Stop it, Silang!

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:46.100
The best chef in China!

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:46.630
The best chef in China!
Fei, that's wonderful!

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:47.200
Fei, that's wonderful!

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:47.950
Thank you, Meili.

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:04.530
Today,

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:05.540
the four-thousand-year history of China

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:07.420
has a brand new start.

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:09.200
The brave young chefs

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:11.430
brought together by fate

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.070
will start the journey

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:16.240
and face the challenges together.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.210
Cooking brings people happiness.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:22.970
Mother, I will never forget

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:25.830
the things I learned from you.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:27.080
In the future,

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:28.450
I will work hard

00:21:28.670 --> 00:21:31.070
to become a chef as good as you.
